WEBVTT

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:30.096
was, "Just be yourself, Herminia."

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:32.496
And of course that was
the worst feedback to get

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:35.586
because the problem was
I was too much myself,

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:38.086
you know, too introverted, too nervous,

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:41.024
too academic, too theoretical --

00:14:41.048 --> 00:14:42.426
all of those things.

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:44.988
AG: But when a colleague suggested
doing the opposite,

00:14:45.012 --> 00:14:46.826
that felt wrong, too.

00:14:46.850 --> 00:14:50.583
HI: He literally said to me, "You have to
be a dog and go mark your territory

00:14:50.607 --> 00:14:54.556
in each the four corners
of that amphitheater."

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.795
AG: In her research,
Herminia wanted to explore

00:14:56.819 --> 00:14:58.476
how we adapt to new roles at work.

00:14:58.500 --> 00:14:59.821
So she launched a study

00:14:59.845 --> 00:15:02.786
of how young professionals
navigate career transitions.